<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia Sept trade deficit halves from August.</title>
<headline>Slovenia Sept trade deficit halves from August.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>SLOVENIA TRADE (in millions of dollars)</p>
<p>				  Sept	  Aug	 Sept95</p>
<p>    Trade balance	  -51.6	-117.5	-26.8</p>
<p>    Exports		  700.5	 486.7	735.6</p>
<p>    Imports		  752.2	 604.2	762.4</p>
<p>NOTE - all figures are rounded.</p>
<p>-- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
